[
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4A0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CF2AEXHR001",
    "text": "Design docs, dev status, and reports for the Aperas project, tracked as `ArtifactNode`/`FolderNode`\ncontent in ApeironNgn's own knowledge graph (`Aperas-apeironngn-design.md`) — this tree is both\ndocumentation and a live corpus the substrate ingests itself.",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV47G000",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4B0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CF2AEXHR003",
    "text": "Superseded design docs, kept for history rather than deleted. `Aperas-design.md` is the original\ntop-level roadmap this project worked from before the ApeironNgn migration; `tdb-era/` holds the\nolder TerminusDB-backed designs that migration replaced.",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4A8000",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4BG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CF2AEXK0001",
    "text": "Design docs from when Aperas was built on TerminusDB, before the ApeironNgn migration\n(`Aperas-apeironngn-design.md`) replaced that storage engine outright. Kept for the history behind\ndecisions still in force today, not as current guidance — none of these describe the live system.",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4B0007",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4C0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CDCTCZQ8001",
    "text": "Working reports separate from the design docs one level up — currently just `bugs/`, filed while\ninvestigating unexpected behavior in the live system.",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4CG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CDCTCZQG001",
    "text": "Open bug reports. Each is filed once a real, reproduced defect is found in the live ApeironNgn\nsubstrate; once fixed and verified, its report moves to `resolved/` rather than being deleted, so\nthe investigation stays around as a record. No open reports at the moment.",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV4D0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CDCTCZQG003",
    "text": "Closed bug reports, moved here from `bugs/` once the underlying defect was fixed and the fix was\nverified live — kept as a record of what broke and why, not left in the open-bugs folder above.",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
