  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBZ7698008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**2026-09-08: slug-anchor convention prototyped**",
    "text": "**2026-09-08: slug-anchor convention prototyped**: <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBZ7698008' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> slug-anchor authoring convention (`slugify()`-derived, `/`-joined segment paths as explicit `<a name>` anchors, referenced via plain `#fragment` links) prototyped and validated live in `test-slugifed-path.md`, as a more compact, pre-ingestion-friendly alternative to hand-typing the full-heading-text `[[deep-path]]` form, e.g.:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ7698003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDC0D8P0009",
      "BlockNode:00CDC0D8P000A"
