    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77EG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Implementation Plan",
    "text": "Two slices carry [design/linking.md](../design/linking.md)'s addressing convention to a working implementation:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77EG001",
