    "title": "A heading with a hand-written tree-anchor at line-end",
    "text": "A heading with a hand-written tree-anchor at line-end: <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBZ77F8004' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> `title` is clean, the anchor survives in a prop, and projecting re-emits both anchors at line end in the right order.",
