    "text": "**Task 2** (step 14): <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBZ77F800C' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> (a) two blocks with an identical fresh path in the same doc are rejected, (b) a new block colliding with another live block's current `toPath()` is rejected, (c) a new block colliding with another live block's still-embedded anchor name is also rejected, (d) no false positive when paths are genuinely distinct.",
