    "text": "**Discussion**: [Motivation and the options considered](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G006) — why this needs packaging, and why a single dispatcher over many bins.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG000",
