    "text": "**Dependencies** (already checked once this session, re-confirmed): `oxigraph`, `@rdfjs/data-model`, `remark-parse`/`remark-gfm`/`remark-frontmatter`/`unified`/`unist-util-visit` are core/cli. `solid-js`/`lucide-solid`/`clsx` are web-only. Two more worth flagging: `terminusdb` and `rehype-stringify`/`remark-rehype` — grepped `src/` for both, **zero hits**. Likely dead deps left over from the pre-ApeironNgn TerminusDB era (`AperasKG/artifacts/archive/tdb-era/`) and some abandoned markdown->HTML rendering path. Candidates to drop entirely rather than assign to any package — need a decision, not just a mechanical move.",
