    "title": "00CDGPBDKG008",
    "text": "Where exactly is the core/cli boundary? Every `kgX.ts` is a thin argv/stdio wrapper around a `run*` function + `request()` call to the shared service — is `kgHelp.ts` core or cli-only? Is `apeironNgn/serviceClient.ts` (the RPC client) cli, or does core need it too (probably cli/service-layer, not pure graph engine)?",
