    "title": "00CDGV1RKG002",
    "text": "Create `packages/{core,cli,web}` with their own `package.json`/`tsconfig.json`, matching the file assignment in [Workspace Split](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDGTZHSR001).",
