    "title": "## Freeflow: planning the `aperas` dispatcher itself",
    "text": "The workspace split is done; the dispatcher it was meant to make room for ([Architecture](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG005)) still doesn't exist. Working out the concrete shape before writing any of it.",
    "parent": "ArtifactNode:00CDDTBQWG000",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDH8S908002",
      "BlockNode:00CDH8S908003",
