    ],
    "title": "`aperas` dispatcher",
    "text": "`aperas` dispatcher: every `kgX.ts` exports its own `main()`, a static verb table in `packages/cli/src/aperas.ts` argv-dispatches to it, `npm run aperas -- <verb> <args>` verified identical to the matching `kg:<verb>` script for several read/write verbs, and the full `verify` harness still passes. Still not an installable global binary — that's [the runtime question](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G009), deliberately untouched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVCKCG003",
    "type": "listItem",
