    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Add `aperas.config.json` discovery",
    "text": "Add `aperas.config.json` discovery: upward search from cwd, resolving `graph`/`parent` pointers; fall back to today's hop-counted `getArtifactsDir()` when none is found (so this repo's own dev setup keeps working unmigrated).",
