    "title": "`identity.json` + `aperas identity`, help-text rewrite",
    "text": "`identity.json` + `aperas identity`, help-text rewrite: machine-local `machineNumber` moved out of the env-var-only `APERAS_MACHINE_NUMBER` lookup into `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/aperas/identity.json` (reader/writer plus `aperas identity show`/`set <n>`); every `kgX.ts`'s own `--help`/missing-arg usage line rewritten from `kg:X --` to `aperas <verb>`. Full `verify` suite still passes.",
