    "title": "Explicit-start service redesign",
    "text": "Explicit-start service redesign: `ensureServiceRunning()` no longer auto-spawns — `aperas service start`/`stop`/`restart` (`kgService.ts`) are the only commands touching the service process directly, `start`/`restart` the only place `process.cwd()` is read to resolve+bind a graph. Lock/socket moved to a fixed `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`-based location. Verified live in dev and built-bundle modes, full `verify` suite clean. Resolves [the graph-location question](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G00A).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVCKCG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
