    ],
    "title": "**A full-corpus rename sweep once collided on `archive/Aperas-dev-status.md`**",
    "text": "**A full-corpus rename sweep once collided on `archive/Aperas-dev-status.md`**: noted in [Packaging — Discussion](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDEB141G001) — a path-less `aperas track`/`ingest` sweep aborted on a slug-path collision inside that file. Scoped, path-given ingestion (as this whole migration uses) isn't affected, but nothing should ever invoke a path-less sweep while `archive/` still holds untracked legacy content.",
