    "title": "**TDB-era migration approach**",
    "text": "**TDB-era migration approach**: don't decompose `tdb-era/` docs 1:1 (this includes `Aperas-dev-status.md`, which is TDB-era in origin despite sitting at the `archive/` top level — pulled out of `tdb-era/` only because its coverage spans many future dev phases too broad for that folder). For whatever knowledge in them is still live in the current (ApeironNgn) system, author brand-new concern docs reflecting today's understanding — following Document Topology from the start, with concern names chosen up front to avoid any collision (no post-hoc rename needed, unlike the `cli.md` → `packaging.md` incident). Anything no longer live goes to that concern's `history` doc as retired background, not carried into `design`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE0HD0HG000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
