    "title": "**Why newest-first**",
    "text": "**Why newest-first**: The ApeironNgn-era docs describe the substrate this migration itself runs on (`store.ts`, `artifacts.ts`, reconciliation, addressing) — getting that into the graph early means later sub-tasks (including the TDB-era ones, which are pure history at this point) can link back to live design docs instead of archived prose. TDB-era docs don't block anything downstream, so they go last.",
