    "title": "**Implementation-status verification (`Aperas-treeview-design.md` §11/§13.3/§14/§15/§16)**",
    "text": "**Implementation-status verification (`Aperas-treeview-design.md` §11/§13.3/§14/§15/§16)**: checked directly against `apeironNgn`/CLI source. §11 (`Profile`/`kg:profile`) and §13.3 (the upward-pointing-link fix in viewcone zoom) are fully implemented — the archived doc's \"not yet implemented\" claims were stale; both move to `history/treeview.md`. §14 (stale `TreeView.unfolds` references), §15 (bare `kg:unfold` should peek, not mutate), and §16 (`kg:show <ref>`) are confirmed still not implemented — all three move to `issues/treeview.md` + `planning/treeview.md`.",
