    "title": "00CE1DDF58005",
    "text": "**Inventory of `Aperas-treeview-design.md`** (967 lines, header + 16 numbered sections, several with subsections): a mature, mostly-settled design doc for the `Profile`/`TreeView` data model, the fold/unfold mechanic, the three-tier rendering algorithm, the canonical-position rule for multi-path nodes, and viewcone zoom — most sections are marked `Status: implemented`. Proposed per-section split:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1DDF58003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CE1DDF58006",
      "BlockNode:00CE1DDF58007",
