    "title": "00CE1DDF5800B",
    "text": "§16 (`kg:show <ref>` / raw single-node inspection, relocated here from packaging) → `issues/treeview.md` + `planning/treeview.md`. Confirmed still genuinely open: `issues/packaging.md`'s own Resolved section explicitly deferred it here (\"moved to `AperasKG/artifacts/archive/Aperas-treeview-design.md` §16, to be picked up when that document itself gets migrated\"), and [the `aperas` skill's own item 8](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEDP10P8001) independently names the same gap — already partly landed there as `scripts/show_node.py`'s skill-script stage, with `aperas show <ref>` here as the remaining toolset-update stage of the same lifecycle.",
