    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CE1DDF5800C",
    "text": "§11 (`Profile` becomes real identity — `kg:profile`) claims `Status: designed, not yet implemented` — contradicted directly by this session's own use of `aperas profile create`/`create-view`/`list`/`list-view`/`remove`/`remove-view`. Pending the verification pass, this very likely becomes a `history/treeview.md` entry (done), not a `planning/treeview.md` task.",
