    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1FFSR8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The two ingest/parser gaps parked in `discussion/archive-migration.md`'s Checkpoints move here**",
    "text": "**The two ingest/parser gaps parked in `discussion/archive-migration.md`'s Checkpoints move here**: per direct instruction, the GFM task-list round-trip bug and `List`-not-consumed-by-`Heading` gap get fixed together with the treeview-specific gaps above — filed into `issues/treeview.md` alongside them, a real dedicated home now that one exists, rather than staying parked indefinitely.",
