    "title": "`TreeView.unfolds` staleness",
    "text": "`TreeView.unfolds` staleness: build the audit/prune sweep (walk every `TreeView`'s `unfolds` list, on some cadence or on demand, stripping any entry that no longer resolves to a live node) — the fix that actually closes the gap. Add write-time validation in `TreeView.unfold(ref)` alongside it as a cheap complementary check, not a substitute. One-time manual cleanup needed regardless for the 10 already-stale ids in the live `.state/TreeView.jsonld`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Bare `aperas unfold <ref>` (no `--view` at all)",
    "text": "Bare `aperas unfold <ref>` (no `--view` at all): make it peek — resolve and print the preview, calling neither `view.unfold(id)` nor the default-view bootstrap. Reserve the bootstrap-and-mutate behavior for `--view` supplied with no name following it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "`aperas show <ref>`",
    "text": "`aperas show <ref>`: resolve `<ref>` the normal way, then print its raw stored fields untransformed — full `text`, `props`, `tombstonedAt`, and `path`/`title`/`type` as actually recorded, no truncation, no anchor stripping, no rendering.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CE1GW7CG008",
    "text": "Fix the GFM task-list round-trip bug (parser/serializer, likely `astParser.ts`'s task-list handling).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CE1GW7CG009",
    "text": "Fix `List` not being consumed by a preceding `Heading` the way a single paragraph already is.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
