    ],
    "title": "00CE1GW8T8005",
    "text": "`Profile`/`TreeView` data model, three-tier rendering (`aperas tree --view`, `aperas unfold`/`aperas fold`), and the canonical-position rule for a node reachable more than one way: implemented and verified against a synthetic graph.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Checked live against the real mirror",
    "text": "Checked live against the real mirror: `AperasKG/Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld` had 1220 `\"unfolded\": false` entries and zero `true` (`ArtifactNode.jsonld`: 1, also `false`) — nothing had ever actually set the old single-flag field. Dropped from `BASE_NODE_SHAPE`/`BaseNode` outright, no migration or default-view seeding needed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Depth-legibility marker (`'│ '` per level, replacing plain-space indent)",
    "text": "Depth-legibility marker (`'│ '` per level, replacing plain-space indent): implemented across every indent site (`renderTreeLines`, `renderViewLines`, `renderLinkLine`, the pruned-children marker).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Viewcone zoom (`discoverCone`/`emitNode`/`emitLinkLine`/`renderTreeWithView`)",
    "text": "Viewcone zoom (`discoverCone`/`emitNode`/`emitLinkLine`/`renderTreeWithView`): implemented, live-verified against a synthetic graph reproducing the worked example byte-for-byte.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "`Profile`/`kg:profile` (`aperas profile create/list/remove/create-view/list-view/remove-view`)",
    "text": "`Profile`/`kg:profile` (`aperas profile create/list/remove/create-view/list-view/remove-view`): confirmed fully implemented — `Profile`/`TreeView` classes and their shapes match the proposed schema field-for-field (`apeironNgn/node.ts`, `apeironNgn/shape.ts`), CLI wired in `kgProfile.ts`. The archived design doc's \"designed, not yet implemented\" status was stale by the time this was checked.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "The upward-pointing-link fix in viewcone zoom",
    "text": "The upward-pointing-link fix in viewcone zoom: confirmed fully implemented, in a more general form than originally proposed — `isInCone` is checked against every cone currently active in the discovery chain (`apeironNgn/node.ts`'s `discoverCone`), not only the query's initial root apex, closing the gap for a nested cone's own upward links too, not just the root cone's.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T800B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CE1GW8T800B",
    "text": "The canonical-position rule was loosened from an earlier, narrower version that required a node's home to separately have its own `unfolds` entry *and* a genuinely-unfolded parent — a real gap surfaced a case where a link targeting a pure breadcrumb node several levels above something genuinely unfolded would \"win\" and duplicate content the breadcrumb's own passthrough chain was already rendering underneath it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T800C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T800C:links:Link:00CE1J3P48000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CE1GW638005",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T800C:links:Link:00CE1J3P48000:props:StringProp:00CE1J3P48001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "302"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "A misdesign was caught in the default-view bootstrap",
    "text": "A misdesign was caught in the default-view bootstrap: a bare `aperas unfold <ref>` with no `--view` flag was originally intended as a read-only peek, but the bootstrap convenience added later made it fall back to auto-creating and mutating the `\"default\"` view instead — not yet corrected in code (see [Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638005)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW8T8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
