    "title": "00CE8T6W7G001",
    "text": "**`aperas unfold` doesn't mark tombstoned children; both `unfold` and `tree` should hide them by default**: `aperas tree --view <name>` appends a `(tombstoned)` suffix to a tombstoned node's line; `aperas unfold` shows the identical node with no marker at all, indistinguishable from a live sibling — confirmed live, see [Discussion](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE8T49MR001). Proposed direction: don't just bring `unfold` in line with `tree`'s tag — suppress tombstoned nodes from both commands' default output, and add a `--tombstoned` flag to opt into seeing them. No fix designed yet.",
