    "title": "00CF068JQ0001",
    "text": "**The disk-first/graph-first split this migration's own design names is the same scope boundary aperas-skill already settled**: [Architecture](../design/archive-migration.md#id/BlockNode:00CE01XZPG008) describes migrating a legacy doc via \"the disk-first path the `kg-doc-ingest` skill defines for a genuinely new, not-yet-tracked doc set\" — the exact same `kg-doc-ingest`-owns-disk-first / `aperas`-owns-graph-first boundary [already settled in aperas-skill's own discussion](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CE8XWZK000B). Restated independently in both places rather than cited once; worth knowing they're the same rule if either one drifts.",
