    "title": "**Issues**",
    "text": "**Issues**: [Open Issues](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG002) — the cross-cutting bugs with no single sub-part home, plus a rollup of each sub-part's own.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZE10002",
