    "title": "00CF1WZE10004",
    "text": "**Planning**: [Task Breakdown](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003) — the ordered fix plan for the Open Issues above. Design and History are still not written — deferred until the fixes actually settle the architecture.",
