    "title": "## Implementation Plan",
    "text": "Fix by shared root cause, not by filing order. Three of these [Open Issues](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG002) are explicitly \"flagged from reproduced symptom, not source\" — `reconcile.ts`'s actual matching logic hasn't been read yet — so investigation comes before any diff, not interleaved with it. Group A shares one file and plausibly one fix; item 6 shares its shape of fix (validate everything before writing anything) with `cli`'s own item 5, even though the two now live in separate concerns; the seventh item is a missing feature, not a bug, and is deferred alongside the (separately deferred) CRUD work rather than forced into this batch.",
